{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You awaken to a world turned upside down, with no memory of who you are or how you got here. Survival is a tightrope walk. Your immediate priority: secure a <strong>vehicle</strong> to escape the island's capital and venture into new territories.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/a1ee3d58ef25c01c7430741dbac5089f.poster.avif?t=1773838222\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/a1ee3d58ef25c01c7430741dbac5089f.webm?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/a1ee3d58ef25c01c7430741dbac5089f.mp4?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>mobile home</strong> isn't just a ride; it's your life support. Explore, gather resources, hunt for food, craft essential tools and weapons, and fortify your rolling sanctuary \u2013 you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/3b84c55a9a9cb4bee3de67758dc4175f.poster.avif?t=1773838222\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/3b84c55a9a9cb4bee3de67758dc4175f.webm?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/3b84c55a9a9cb4bee3de67758dc4175f.mp4?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character's skills and perks to match your survival strategy, hoard unique outfits, and collect mythical weapons. <br>It's all a race against time to <strong>uncover the truth</strong> and survive the <strong>ultimate revelation</strong>...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3511360?t=1773838222","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/02ebbf0ca53da54e197d0527ee5591be7287b6c4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773838222","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/a450f63568fbe27b913a9b1302b5b9554abfdadb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773838222","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/a450f63568fbe27b913a9b1302b5b9554abfdadb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773838222","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You awaken to a world turned upside down, with no memory of who you are or how you got here. Survival is a tightrope walk. Your immediate priority: secure a <strong>vehicle</strong> to escape the island's capital and venture into new territories.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/a1ee3d58ef25c01c7430741dbac5089f.poster.avif?t=1773838222\" width=800 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/a1ee3d58ef25c01c7430741dbac5089f.webm?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/a1ee3d58ef25c01c7430741dbac5089f.mp4?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your <strong>mobile home</strong> isn't just a ride; it's your life support. Explore, gather resources, hunt for food, craft essential tools and weapons, and fortify your rolling sanctuary \u2013 you'll need it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/3b84c55a9a9cb4bee3de67758dc4175f.poster.avif?t=1773838222\" width=574 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/3b84c55a9a9cb4bee3de67758dc4175f.webm?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/extras/3b84c55a9a9cb4bee3de67758dc4175f.mp4?t=1773838222\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your character's skills and perks to match your survival strategy, hoard unique outfits, and collect mythical weapons. <br>It's all a race against time to <strong>uncover the truth</strong> and survive the <strong>ultimate revelation</strong>...</p>","developers":["Gaia n' Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3511360/74d73f8045e70bd17b167c41c9a5b61c89bdbc47/header.jpg?t=1773838222","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3511360/84787072/6663c0020e887d479109b830fea4736092f62440/1757078877/dash_av1.mpd?t=1770388350","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3511360/84787072/6663c0020e887d479109b830fea4736092f62440/1757078877/dash_h264.mpd?t=1770388350","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3511360/84